WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.320
Illinois and the city of Chicago are filing a lawsuit against the Trump

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:07.040
administration over deployments of National Guard troops. Joining us now to

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.440
comment White House Deputy Chief of Staff for Policy Stephen Miller. My

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:14.960
question was whether the administration still plans to abide by that judge's

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:18.520
order restricting any National Guard troops from being sent to Oregon.

